{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-autograph-collection","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"autograph-collection","about":"Damac Properties proudly introduces the Damac Autograph Collection, an exclusive selection of boutique villas that redefine luxury. Nestled within the prestigious community of Damac Hills, the Autograph Collection Villas are a testament to opulent living. This newest venture, the Autograph Collection at Damac Hills, brought to you by Damac Properties, features an array of stunning 4 to 7-bedroom boutique villas, showcasing the Damac Autograph Collection villas for sale.Damac Properties presents a limited edition of homes within the Autograph Collection by Damac, where every detail reflects timeless luxury and groundbreaking sophistication. These villas promise a lifestyle that captures the essence of balanced living, merging tranquility with contemporary elegance. The villas for sale at Damac Hills are perfectly situated to offer an optimum blend of serenity and accessibility. Its proximity to major highways like Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Al Khail Road ensures easy access to Dubai’s attractions and business districts. The Dubai International Airport is also conveniently located about 40 minutes away, making the property for sale at Damac Hills a prime choice for discerning buyers.Step into a world where luxury is boundless with the Autograph Boutique Villas Collection by Damac, where living is transformed into an exquisite art form.","price":5100000,"title":"Autograph Collection","bitrix":{"id":388,"pf_id":"are.2.13782","source":null,"project_id":"Autograph Collection","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Autograph Collection","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"DAMAC Properties","project_location":"DAMAC Hills"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/autograph_feature_b8cd01c18e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330v